    "created_at": "2024-04-02T03:30:16Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-04-02T03:30:16Z",
    "body": "It's pretty hard to imagine how any meta elements could run scripts. I agree probably implementers won't want to invest any effort in changing this, but I wish we would, because this is bizarre.",
