    "created_at": "2024-04-02T03:40:38Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-04-02T03:40:38Z",
    "body": "Yeah the only thing I can imagine would be unload or pagehide in a meta refresh, but those are actually unconditionally scheduled asynchronously anyways, so the script wouldn't run right away. I'll try and sniff around for other cases that motivated the original change, to see if they're still relevant.",
